     "], {{0, 319.2}, {299.4, 0}}, {0, 255},
     ColorFunction->RGBColor,
     ImageResolution->{120., 120.},
     RasterInterpolation->"High"],
    BoxForm`ImageTag["Byte", ColorSpace -> "RGB", Interleaving -> True],
    Selectable->False],
   DefaultBaseStyle->"ImageGraphics",
   ImageSize->{406.6, Automatic},
   ImageSizeRaw->{299.4, 319.2},
   PlotRange->{{0, 299.4}, {0, 319.2}}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "3db4208b-ed3e-b042-bfb3-cd23ddc36653"],
 "\n\nLa concentraci\[OAcute]n o densidad de l\[IAcute]neas indica la \
velocidad. En la regi\[OAcute]n donde las l\[IAcute]neas est\[AAcute]n pr\
\[OAcute]ximas entre s\[IAcute] (alta densidad) la velocidad es alta y en la \
regi\[OAcute]n donde la densidad es baja (l\[IAcute]neas espaciadas) la \
velocidad es baja. En un ",
 StyleBox["flujo estacionario o laminar",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (de bajas velocidades) las l\[IAcute]neas de flujo son estables en el \
tiempo; en cambio en un ",
 StyleBox["flujo turbulento",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (ca\[OAcute]tico o de altas velocidades y direcciones cambiantes) las l\
\[IAcute]neas de flujo cambian constantemente."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9687854248110504`*^9, 3.968785493066572*^9}, {
  3.9687855619401474`*^9, 3.9687855875721264`*^9}, {3.9687856497701607`*^9, 
  3.968785665593752*^9}, {3.9687877476369324`*^9, 3.9687877476369324`*^9}, {
  3.9799057586531353`*^9, 3.979905768851713*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"b7d41b4f-66ee-8d44-a704-9642d205f204"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Caudal o gasto ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "Q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3c368dc6-4f9a-7745-a6b3-28adea14d24d"],
 ": es el volumen transportado por cada unidad de tiempo.  Finalmente es el \
producto de \[AAcute]rea de la secci\[OAcute]n transversal por la velocidad:"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968785727127428*^9, 3.9687857337485447`*^9}, {
  3.9687857684442787`*^9, 3.9687857868643875`*^9}, {3.968785818532812*^9, 
  3.9687858190636616`*^9}, {3.9799058061017017`*^9, 3.979905809590744*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"21b6cc0c-0594-904f-b89a-f6e7e18e65da"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
       StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["v", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
   "Q = S v", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979905790381401*^9, 3.979905798543207*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"027e504a-d2a4-1b46-aba8-f48d4dfecce5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Consideremos el flujo de un fluido incompresible, tal como se indica en la \
figura 3.6 En la secci\[OAcute]n de \[AAcute]rea ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "S_1", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "33816b61-e7a5-5f47-a60a-d4705540f3b2"],
 " la velocidad media es ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "v_1", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "81390a9e-0f3d-4c4d-9ed9-90b3163b8671"],
 " y en la secci\[OAcute]n de \[AAcute]rea ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "S_2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1f597f87-b31c-b442-904b-9cc641d9483c"],
 " la velocidad es ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "v_2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f02fd8b4-e4f4-5540-9874-4bbb07d257c7"],
 ". El volumen que pasa por ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "S_1", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5381e6a4-dd5d-a540-b9c5-cdfafe33f902"],
 " en la unidad de tiempo es el mismo que el que pasa por ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "S_2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c1b5d360-18f7-be48-868c-a22fe4a70f64"],
 ", puesto que el fluido es incompresible. \n\nEsto es: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "1"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "Q _1 = Q_2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "03ca82d2-4e3d-3244-ae77-a427130b95be"],
 ", por tanto:"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968787633213043*^9, 3.968787723277012*^9}, {
  3.9799058194124584`*^9, 3.979905819580496*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"7a811f87-64e9-3247-ae18-8a549aa05fa3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "1"], 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], "\[LongEqual]", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["S", "TI"], "2"], 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
